Source: disktree
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 libxcb1,
 libxkbcommon0,
 libxkbcommon-x11-0
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Homepage: https://github.com/tobi/disktree
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: disktree
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 libwayland-client0,
 libegl1,
 libvulkan1
Description: disk space treemap
 Disktree draws a volume as a treemap, by kind of file, so that what fills the
 disk is visible at a glance. Select what should go and remove it, to the trash
 or for good.
